        "original_id": "6e6814e8-7242-50d4-9a2c-0363ea01c271",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peggy Seeger, Ewan MacColl\n- Places: Britain\n- Roles: folksinger, singer-songwriter, actor, poet, playwright, record producer, labour activist\n\nFacts:\n- Peggy Seeger was born on June 17, 1935, and is an American folksinger.\n- Ewan MacColl was born as James Henry Miller on January 25, 1915, and became known by his stage name Ewan MacColl.\n- Ewan MacColl was an English folk singer, songwriter, communist, labour activist, actor, poet, playwright, and record producer.\n- Peggy Seeger lived in Britain for more than 30 years and became well known there.\n- Peggy Seeger was married to Ewan MacColl until his death on October 22, 1989.",
